                    Job Overview



We are looking for an experienced Senior Full Stack AI Engineer to design, build, and deploy AI-powered applications from concept to production. This role combines modern full-stack software engineering with practical AI implementation, including Large Language Models (LLMs), AI agents, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), workflow automation, and cloud-native architecture.



You will work across the entire technology stack—from intuitive frontend interfaces to scalable backend APIs and AI infrastructure—while helping shape the future of intelligent software products.



This is an ideal opportunity for someone who enjoys solving complex technical challenges, rapidly shipping products, and staying at the forefront of AI innovation.



Key Responsibilities

}~} Design, develop, and maintain scalable full-stack web applications.

}~} Build and integrate AI-powered features using modern LLMs and AI APIs.

}~} Develop AI agents capable of executing multi-step workflows and business processes.

}~} Implement Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems using vector databases.

}~} Build secure REST APIs and backend services.

}~} Architect cloud-native applications with scalability, reliability, and security in mind.

}~} Develop responsive frontend interfaces using modern JavaScript frameworks.

}~} Optimize application performance and AI inference costs.

}~} Integrate third-party APIs, SaaS platforms, and automation tools.

}~} Collaborate with product managers, designers, and engineering teams to deliver high-quality software.

}~} Write clean, maintainable, and well-tested code.

}~} Participate in technical architecture decisions and mentor junior developers.

}~} Stay current with emerging AI technologies and recommend improvements.



Required Qualifications

}~} 5+ years of professional full-stack software engineering experience.

}~} 2+ years building production AI applications.

}~} Strong experience with JavaScript/TypeScript.

}~} Strong backend experience with Python and/or Node.js.

}~} Experience with React, Next.js, Vue, or similar frontend frameworks.

}~} Experience designing RESTful APIs.

}~} Hands-on experience integrating Large Language Models (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, etc.).

}~} Experience building AI agents and automation workflows.

}~} Knowledge of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).

}~} Experience with vector databases such as Pinecone, Weaviate, Qdrant, Chroma, or pgvector.

}~} Experience with relational and NoSQL databases.

}~} Familiarity with Docker and containerized deployments.

}~} Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud).

}~} Strong understanding of software architecture and design patterns.

}~} Excellent debugging and problem-solving skills.

}~} Strong written and verbal English communication skills.



Preferred Qualifications

}~} Experience with LangChain, LangGraph, LlamaIndex, or similar AI orchestration frameworks.

}~} Experience with Model Context Protocol (MCP).

}~} Experience deploying open-source LLMs.

}~} Knowledge of fine-tuning and prompt engineering best practices.

}~} Experience with CI/CD pipelines.

}~} Experience using Kubernetes.

}~} Familiarity with event-driven architectures.

}~} Experience integrating payment systems, authentication, and SaaS platforms.

}~} Previous startup or fast-paced product development experience.

}~} Experience leading engineering teams or mentoring developers.



