}~} Build scalable backend APIs and services using Node.js.

}~} Develop RESTful APIs and integrate third-party services.

}~} Collaborate with UI/UX designers to create responsive and intuitive user interfaces.

}~} Integrate mobile applications with backend systems and databases.

}~} Optimize application performance, scalability, and security.

}~} Debug, troubleshoot, and resolve application issues.

}~} Write clean, reusable, and maintainable code following best practices.

}~} Participate in code reviews and technical discussions.

